{"path":"numeric/random/independent_bits_engine/discard","title":"std::independent_bits_engine<Engine,W,UIntType>::discard","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::independent_bits_engine&lt;Engine,W,UIntType&gt;::</span>discard","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/independent_bits_engine/discard","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Advances the internal state by z times. Equivalent to calling operator() z times and discarding the result. The state of the underlying engine may be advanced by more than z times.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> discard<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Advances the internal state by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> times. Equivalent to calling <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/independent_bits_engine/operator()\">operator()</a></span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> times and discarding the result. The state of the underlying engine may be advanced by more than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> times.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> z\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> integer value specifying the number of times to advance the state by\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/independent_bits_engine/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances the state of the underlying engine and returns the generated value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/independent_bits_engine","title":"std::independent_bits_engine"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::independent_bits_engine<Engine,W,UIntType>::discard","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Advances the internal state by z times. Equivalent to calling operator() z times and discarding the result."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"z"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator()","note":"advances the state of the underlying engine and returns the generated value"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":79,"codeBlockCount":0}
